 The new major runtime pieces are `AGCScale20LosslessPipeline`, `AGCNetworkBackboneGraph`, `AGCChunkWorksetSlicer`, `AGCEntityWitnessIndex`, `AGCWorldSemanticScheduler`, `AGCPluginDeterminismGuard` and `AGCResourcePlacementPlanner`. These are deliberately algorithmic rather than cosmetic: they reserve CPU/memory for primary-thread gameplay, plugins, Netty, GC and OS, then spend remaining capacity only on read-only helper work such as packet backbone planning, FIFO-compatible chunk worksets, entity witness indexing and semantic world-slot planning.
 
 Operator report: `/agc scale20`. Public API: `AGC.performance().scale20Plan(players, targetTps)` and `AGCScale20Plan`.
+
+## Alpha21 critical-path survival runtime
+
+AGC alpha21 keeps the hard performance contract from alpha20 and moves the next large optimisation pass into a critical-path runtime. The goal is ordinary survival scale: thousands of players, 20 TPS target, and no change to Minecraft-visible semantics.
+
+New alpha21 components:
+
+- `AGCScale21CriticalPathRuntime`: budgets only invisible work that can shorten the next visible tick path.
+- `AGCPlayerClusterMovementPlanner`: groups nearby/moving players into stable planning cohorts without hiding players or changing view distance.
+- `AGCChunkStormController`: smooths exploration/chunk bursts with FIFO-compatible slices; it never skips the chunk queue head or changes completion order.
+- `AGCEntityDensityField`: builds read-only density bands so entity tracker candidate work can be shared without skipping entity ticks, AI, damage or interactions.
+- `AGCNetworkBroadcastPlanner`: compiles lossless broadcast/cohort plans while preserving per-connection packet order and never sharing mutable packet instances.
+- `AGCPluginCommitSequencer`: gives plugin-visible operations deterministic commit tickets and keeps Bukkit-visible mutation on the ordered primary-thread lane.
+- `AGCMultiverseLaneAllocator`: allocates read-only prepare lanes across worlds while keeping block/fluid ticks, block entities, entities, redstone and plugin events behind ordered barriers.
+- `AGCComputeWasteReducer`: records estimated duplicate helper work avoided by packet, chunk, entity, world and plugin planning.
+
+The alpha21 command surface is `/agc scale21`.
