+
+### Alpha21 - critical-path survival runtime
+
+Status: implemented as the next large optimisation stage.
+
+Alpha21 focuses on the biggest survival-scale hot paths after the alpha20 lossless pipeline:
+
+- player cluster movement planning for exploration-heavy servers;
+- FIFO-preserving chunk storm smoothing;
+- read-only entity density fields for dense bases, farms and spawn regions;
+- lossless network broadcast planning for high-recipient fanout;
+- deterministic plugin commit sequencing;
+- multiverse read-only lane allocation;
+- compute waste accounting so future work can target the largest duplicate helper costs first.
+
+Hard gates remain unchanged: no packet drops, no mutable packet sharing, no connection reorder, no chunk FIFO head skip, no entity tick/AI/damage/interaction skipping, no off-thread Bukkit mutation, no plugin event reorder and no redstone/factory phase reorder.
